    "name": {
      "value": "Greater Pickled Demon Tongue"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "gw2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This small crystal vial contains the forked end of a demon's tongue, preserved in brine. The spell attack roll of any spell cast by Activating this item is +7, and the spell DC is 17. Armor You gain resistance 2 to acid and attacks by demons. Weapon After you cast an acid spell by Activating the pickled demon tongue, your Strikes with the weapon deal an additional 1d4 acid damage until end of your next turn. You cast acid splash. Resistance when affixed to armor is 5, extra damage when affixed to a weapon is 1d6, the spell attack roll is +14, and the spell DC is 24. You cast 3rd-level acidic burst."
    },
